helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\indices_form.xhp	0	help	par_id3150712	51			0	nl	Klik met de rechtermuisknop in de inhoudsopgave en kies dan \<emph\>Index/inhoudsopgave bewerken\</emph\>.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\indices_form.xhp	0	help	par_id3150738	42			0	nl	Klik op de tab \<emph\>Items\</emph\>.				20130618 17:22:18
