helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\rounding_numbers.xhp	0	help	par_id3150045	12			0	nl	Kies \<emph\>\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>%PRODUCTNAME - Voorkeuren\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Extra - Opties\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> - %PRODUCTNAME Calc\</emph\>.				20130618 17:22:18
